   "originalText": "Shown: Momus working tree of 2026-11-26  |  scanner base kalilinux/kali-rolling@sha256:69a9a33d98a5  |  brain base python:3.13-slim@sha256:7249d5587b78  |  policy code: brain/app/jobs.py, scanner/runner.py, scanner/recon.sh, scanner/entrypoint.sh, scanner/pipeline/scope.py, approve.py, classify.py",
