   "text": "DNS proof: TXT at _scan-verify.\n<domain>, asked at each of its\nnameservers, no recursion; all\nthat answer must match a token\nderived from the install secret.\nLookup failed: still counts for\n7 days after the last match",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e3",
   "originalText": "DNS proof: TXT at _scan-verify.\n<domain>, asked at each of its\nnameservers, no recursion; all\nthat answer must match a token\nderived from the install secret.\nLookup failed: still counts for\n7 days after the last match",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
