   "locked": false,
   "text": "Approval check: the approval binds\nto one finished inventory of this\nscope; checked on receipt, at the\nstart, before nmap and nuclei.\nHeld back: a host new since that\ninventory, at a new address outside\nowned and provider ranges, or\nunder a domain added later",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
