   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1   Domain added, with the\n    ownership statement\n\n2   Brain checks the scope and\n    writes the job file\n\n3   Job runner reads and\n    checks the job\n\n4   Scope status published: the\n    TXT record you publish\n\n5   DNS proof: TXT question to\n    each of your nameservers\n\n6   Inventory: probes to every\n    host that passes the gates\n\n7   Admin approves one\n    inventory\n\n8   Full job: approval bound,\n    new hosts held back\n\n9   Active checks to approved\n    hosts only\n\n10  Admin reads each outcome",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1   Domain added, with the\n    ownership statement\n\n2   Brain checks the scope and\n    writes the job file\n\n3   Job runner reads and\n    checks the job\n\n4   Scope status published: the\n    TXT record you publish\n\n5   DNS proof: TXT question to\n    each of your nameservers\n\n6   Inventory: probes to every\n    host that passes the gates\n\n7   Admin approves one\n    inventory\n\n8   Full job: approval bound,\n    new hosts held back\n\n9   Active checks to approved\n    hosts only\n\n10  Admin reads each outcome",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
